    <briefdescription>
<para>Class which can be overriden by targets to modify the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1mca_1_1_instruction" kindref="compound">mca::Instruction</ref> objects before the pipeline starts. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A common usage of this class is to add immediate operands to certain instructions or to remove Defs/Uses from an instruction where the schedulinng model is incorrect. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
